AIR Authors
===========

Creator and maintainer:

- [Dmitriy Shtro](https://www.linkedin.com/in/dmitrii-sky-64024810a/?skipRedirect=true)

AI-assisted development note:

AIR was created and is directed by Dmitriy Shtro. AIR is developed with AI
assistance under human direction: product direction, architecture constraints,
acceptance criteria, review orchestration, evidence gates, release decisions,
and the AI-assisted engineering process.

AI tools may assist implementation, review, test generation, documentation, and
release hygiene. Authorship, project direction, and release responsibility are
not assigned to those tools.

Contributor policy:

External contributors may be added here after contribution process and license
acceptance rules are finalized. Unless otherwise stated in a signed agreement,
accepted contributions are submitted under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
